{"name":"Oath","hex":"#4a465a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"oath","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A solemn pledge or promise that invokes a deity, a ruler, or another entity (not necessarily present) to attest the truth of a statement or sincerity of one's desire to fulfill a contract or promise.","A statement or promise which is strengthened (affirmed) by such a pledge."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To pledge."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/oath"}],"entries":[{"title":"Oath","blocks":[{"text":"Traditionally, an oath is a statement of fact or a promise taken by a sacrality as a sign of verity. A common legal substitute for those who object to making sacred oaths is to give an affirmation instead. Nowadays, even when there is no notion of sanctity involved, certain promises said out loud in ceremonial or juridical purpose are referred to as oaths. \"To swear\" is a verb used to describe the taking of an oath; to make a solemn vow."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Sec_of_State_Kissinger.png/330px-Sec_of_State_Kissinger.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oath","wikidata":"Q381045"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg/500px-Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg/1280px-Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg/500px-Le_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Tennis Court Oath\" by Jacques-Louis David","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALe_Serment_du_Jeu_de_paume.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/500px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/1280px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg/500px-Juramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJuramento_da_Reg%C3%AAncia_Trina.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Juramento_Isabel.jpg/500px-Juramento_Isabel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Juramento_Isabel.jpg/1280px-Juramento_Isabel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Juramento_Isabel.jpg/500px-Juramento_Isabel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJuramento_Isabel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Bheeshma_oath_by_RRV.jpg/500px-Bheeshma_oath_by_RRV.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Bheeshma_oath_by_RRV.jpg/500px-Bheeshma_oath_by_RRV.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Devarata taking his bhishama pratigya","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABheeshma_oath_by_RRV.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Officer_Natalie_Corona_swe